          "text": "P'ÊNG Yün-chang 彭蘊章 (T. 琮達, H. 詠莪, 詒穀老人), Aug. 24, 1792–1862, Dec. 29, official, native of Ch'ang-chou, Kiangsu, was a descendant of P'êng Ting-ch'iu [q. v.] in the sixth generation, and a great-grandson of P'êng Ch'i-fêng (see under P'êng Ting-ch'iu).",
